## Inputs
I01. pack05.12: 10 of 10 snapshots match their pins, and live matches all 10, at workshop e97c70f.
- the 05.11 STATE-PROPOSAL (0020eb4f…) and worked-cases (43a7f61b…);
- prime-review05.11 (93bf65cd…), which is SP-01 to SP-04 plus Prime's decisions on DEC-3 and DEC-4;
