- All 17 tests passed on their first run, so I made four mutation checks on a disposable copy. Each was caught: held counted as completed (test_02, test_09); a first-match primary (test_05); the origin book ignored (test_06); commit basis allowed to complete (test_08).
- Not done, and outside scope:
